  "url": "https://baike.mihoyo.com/bh3/wiki/content/1369/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header",
  "title": "月之环-圣芙蕾雅档案馆-崩坏3WIKI",
  "content_id": 1369,
  "main_content": "月之环  基础能力核心能力联合白热U.F-U.Z  月之环基础能力 进入白热状态时，触发莱尔的特殊支援技能进入白热状态时，全队获得1.5秒无敌时间白热状态下，全队抗打断能力提高，获得50%的减伤白热状态下，所有攻击必定暴击，暴击伤害加成为50%白热状态持续10秒 \n      [折叠展开]\n     月之环核心能力 月之环有4个核心，随着月之环等级提升将陆续解锁和升级。4个核心分为普攻核心（默认解锁）、必杀核心（月之环6级解锁）、QTE核心（月之环9级解锁）、闪避核心（月之环12级解锁），每个核心都将强化队伍某一方面的作战能力。由于核心力量过于强大，因此同时可激活的核心是有限的。 \n      [折叠展开]\n     联合白热 Union Fever System由天命开发的小型崩坏能转化-传输网络方案，将单人无法承受的崩坏能增幅，利用其侵蚀性形成网络，将其分摊到共同作战的队员身上。为了实现这一功能，每个处于“U.F.S” 内的队员，都需要佩戴月之环。月之环可以将崩坏能转变为一般能源，并且可以用来组成各个成员间的增幅通道，同时也削减了爆发性释放的崩坏能对人体产生的危害。 \n      [折叠展开]\n     理想限制领域 Union Fever-Unlimited Zone由于小型化造成的功率限制，一般来说，月之环在选择核心组件时必须有所取舍。但根据天命科研部武装开发组给出的报告，月之环的核心功能之一，就是随着佩戴者在实战中采集的数据增多而进化出新机能。理论上，当数据丰度达到理想阈值，月之环将能够突破极限功率、获得新的可能性。这一形态的\"U.F.S\"又被称为「理想限制领域」。然而「理想限制领域」在当前仍处于理论假象阶段，具体的启动条件、启动方式乃至启动的可能性皆为未知。 \n      [折叠展开]\n      \n        词条内容由圣芙蕾雅档案馆编辑团队原创，禁止转载",
  "html_content": "<div data-v-f0365338=\"\"><h1 data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__title\">月之环</h1> <div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__divider\"></div></div> <div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail_tabs\" style=\"top: 0px;\"><div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail_tab detail_tab--active\"><div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail_tab-item\">基础能力</div></div><div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail_tab\"><div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail_tab-item\">核心能力</div></div><div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail_tab\"><div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail_tab-item\">联合白热</div></div><div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail_tab\"><div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail_tab-item\">U.F-U.Z</div></div></div> <div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"\"><div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__content\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl obc-tmpl--col-l2r1\" data-data=\"%5B%7B%22tmplKey%22%3A%22fold%22%2C%22partKey%22%3A%22main%22%2C%22data%22%3A%7B%22layout_%22%3A%22banner%22%2C%22title%22%3A%22%3Cp%20style%3D%5C%22white-space%3A%20pre-wrap%3B%5C%22%3E%E6%9C%88%E4%B9%8B%E7%8E%AF%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%3C%2Fp%3E%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3E%3Cp%20style%3D%5C%22white-space%3A%20pre-wrap%3B%5C%22%3E%E8%BF%9B%E5%85%A5%E7%99%BD%E7%83%AD%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%E6%97%B6%EF%BC%8C%E8%A7%A6%E5%8F%91%E8%8E%B1%E5%B0%94%E7%9A%84%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%E6%94%AF%E6%8F%B4%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3E%3Cp%20style%3D%5C%22white-space%3A%20pre-wrap%3B%5C%22%3E%E8%BF%9B%E5%85%A5%E7%99%BD%E7%83%AD%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%E6%97%B6%EF%BC%8C%E5%85%A8%E9%98%9F%E8%8E%B7%E5%BE%971.5%E7%A7%92%E6%97%A0%E6%95%8C%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3E%3Cp%20style%3D%5C%22white-space%3A%20pre-wrap%3B%5C%22%3E%E7%99%BD%E7%83%AD%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%E4%B8%8B%EF%BC%8C%E5%85%A8%E9%98%9F%E6%8A%97%E6%89%93%E6%96%AD%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%E6%8F%90%E9%AB%98%EF%BC%8C%E8%8E%B7%E5%BE%9750%25%E7%9A%84%E5%87%8F%E4%BC%A4%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3E%3Cp%20style%3D%5C%22white-space%3A%20pre-wrap%3B%5C%22%3E%E7%99%BD%E7%83%AD%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%E4%B8%8B%EF%BC%8C%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E6%94%BB%E5%87%BB%E5%BF%85%E5%AE%9A%E6%9A%B4%E5%87%BB%EF%BC%8C%E6%9A%B4%E5%87%BB%E4%BC%A4%E5%AE%B3%E5%8A%A0%E6%88%90%E4%B8%BA50%25%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3E%3Cp%20style%3D%5C%22white-space%3A%20pre-wrap%3B%5C%22%3E%E7%99%BD%E7%83%AD%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%E6%8C%81%E7%BB%AD10%E7%A7%92%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%22%2C%22defaultOpened%22%3Atrue%7D%7D%5D\" data-ts=\"1669691448873\" data-col-type=\"l2r1\"><div style=\"order: 0;\"> <div data-part=\"main\" data-tmpl=\"fold\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-fold obc-tmpl__part--main obc-tmpl__part--expand obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text obc-tmpl-fold__title\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">月之环基础能力</p></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl__paragraph-box obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><ul><li><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">进入白热状态时，触发莱尔的特殊支援技能</p></li><li><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">进入白热状态时，全队获得1.5秒无敌时间</p></li><li><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">白热状态下，全队抗打断能力提高，获得50%的减伤</p></li><li><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">白热状态下，所有攻击必定暴击，暴击伤害加成为50%</p></li><li><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">白热状态持续10秒</p></li></ul></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl__fold-tag\">\n      [<span class=\"obc-tmpl__fold-text\">折叠</span><span class=\"obc-tmpl__expand-text\">展开</span>]\n    </div></div></div></div><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\"></p></div><div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__content\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl obc-tmpl--col-l2r1\" data-data=\"%5B%7B%22tmplKey%22%3A%22fold%22%2C%22partKey%22%3A%22main%22%2C%22data%22%3A%7B%22layout_%22%3A%22banner%22%2C%22title%22%3A%22%3Cp%20style%3D%5C%22white-space%3A%20pre-wrap%3B%5C%22%3E%E6%9C%88%E4%B9%8B%E7%8E%AF%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%3C%2Fp%3E%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%3Cp%20style%3D%5C%22white-space%3A%20pre-wrap%3B%5C%22%3E%E6%9C%88%E4%B9%8B%E7%8E%AF%E6%9C%894%E4%B8%AA%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%EF%BC%8C%E9%9A%8F%E7%9D%80%E6%9C%88%E4%B9%8B%E7%8E%AF%E7%A