class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-fold obc-tmpl__part--main obc-tmpl__part--expand obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text obc-tmpl-fold__title\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">联合白热</p></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl__paragraph-box obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Union Fever System</span></p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">由天命开发的小型崩坏能转化-传输网络方案，将单人无法承受的崩坏能增幅，利用其侵蚀性形成网络，将其分摊到共同作战的队员身上。为了实现这一功能，每个处于“U.F.S” 内的队员，都需要佩戴月之环。月之环可以将崩坏能转变为一般能源，并且可以用来组成各个成员间的增幅通道，同时也削减了爆发性释放的崩坏能对人体产生的危害。</p></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl__fold-tag\">\n      [<span class=\"obc-tmpl__fold-text\">折叠</span><span class=\"obc-tmpl__expand-text\">展开</span>]\n    </div></div></div></div><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\"></p></div><div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__content\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl obc-tmpl--col-l2r1\" data-data=\"%5B%7B%22tmplKey%22%3A%22fold%22%2C%22partKey%22%3A%22main%22%2C%22data%22%3A%7B%22layout_%22%3A%22banner%22%2C%22title%22%3A%22%3Cp%20style%3D%5C%22white-space%3A%20pre-wrap%3B%5C%22%3E%E7%90%86%E6%83%B3%E9%99%90%E5%88%B6%E9%A2%86%E5%9F%9F%3C%2Fp%3E%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%3Cp%20style%3D%5C%22white-space%3A%20pre-wrap%3B%20text-align%3A%20center%3B%5C%22%3E%3Cspan%20style%3D%5C%22font-size%3A14px%5C%22%3EUnion%20Fever-Unlimited%20Zone%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%20style%3D%5C%22white-space%3A%20pre-wrap%3B%5C%22%3E%E7%94%B1%E4%BA%8E%E5%B0%8F%E5%9E%8B%E5%8C%96%E9%80%A0%E6%88%90%E7%9A%84%E5%8A%9F%E7%8E%87%E9%99%90%E5%88%B6%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E6%9D%A5%E8%AF%B4%EF%BC%8C%E6%9C%88%E4%B9%8B%E7%8E%AF%E5%9C%A8%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E7%BB%84%E4%BB%B6%E6%97%B6%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E6%9C%89%E6%89%80%E5%8F%96%E8%88%8D%E3%80%82%3Cbr%3E%E4%BD%86%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%E5%A4%A9%E5%91%BD%E7%A7%91%E7%A0%94%E9%83%A8%E6%AD%A6%E8%A3%85%E5%BC%80%E5%8F%91%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%99%E5%87%BA%E7%9A%84%E6%8A%A5%E5%91%8A%EF%BC%8C%E6%9C%88%E4%B9%8B%E7%8E%AF%E7%9A%84%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E5%8A%9F%E8%83%BD%E4%B9%8B%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%8C%E5%B0%B1%E6%98%AF%E9%9A%8F%E7%9D%80%E4%BD%A9%E6%88%B4%E8%80%85%E5%9C%A8%E5%AE%9E%E6%88%98%E4%B8%AD%E9%87%87%E9%9B%86%E7%9A%84%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%A2%9E%E5%A4%9A%E8%80%8C%E8%BF%9B%E5%8C%96%E5%87%BA%E6%96%B0%E6%9C%BA%E8%83%BD%E3%80%82%3Cbr%3E%E7%90%86%E8%AE%BA%E4%B8%8A%EF%BC%8C%E5%BD%93%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E4%B8%B0%E5%BA%A6%E8%BE%BE%E5%88%B0%E7%90%86%E6%83%B3%E9%98%88%E5%80%BC%EF%BC%8C%E6%9C%88%E4%B9%8B%E7%8E%AF%E5%B0%86%E8%83%BD%E5%A4%9F%E7%AA%81%E7%A0%B4%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E5%8A%9F%E7%8E%87%E3%80%81%E8%8E%B7%E5%BE%97%E6%96%B0%E7%9A%84%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E6%80%A7%E3%80%82%E8%BF%99%E4%B8%80%E5%BD%A2%E6%80%81%E7%9A%84%5C%22U.F.S%5C%22%E5%8F%88%E8%A2%AB%E7%A7%B0%E4%B8%BA%E3%80%8C%E7%90%86%E6%83%B3%E9%99%90%E5%88%B6%E9%A2%86%E5%9F%9F%E3%80%8D%E3%80%82%3Cbr%3E%E7%84%B6%E8%80%8C%E3%80%8C%E7%90%86%E6%83%B3%E9%99%90%E5%88%B6%E9%A2%86%E5%9F%9F%E3%80%8D%E5%9C%A8%E5%BD%93%E5%89%8D%E4%BB%8D%E5%A4%84%E4%BA%8E%E7%90%86%E8%AE%BA%E5%81%87%E8%B1%A1%E9%98%B6%E6%AE%B5%EF%BC%8C%E5%85%B7%E4%BD%93%E7%9A%84%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%E3%80%81%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E4%B9%83%E8%87%B3%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%E7%9A%84%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E6%80%A7%E7%9A%86%E4%B8%BA%E6%9C%AA%E7%9F%A5%E3%80%82%3C%2Fp%3E%22%2C%22defaultOpened%22%3Atrue%7D%7D%5D\" data-ts=\"1669699876815\" data-col-type=\"l2r1\"><div style=\"order: 0;\"> <div data-part=\"main\" data-tmpl=\"fold\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-fold obc-tmpl__part--main obc-tmpl__part--expand obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text obc-tmpl-fold__title\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">理想限制领域</p></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl__paragraph-box obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Union Fever-Unlimited Zone</span></p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">由于小型化造成的功率限制，一般来说，月之环在选择核心组件时必须有所取舍。<br>但根据天命科研部武装开发组给出的报告，月之环的核心功能之一，就是随着佩戴者在实战中采集的数据增多而进化出新机能。<br>理论上，当数据丰度达到理想阈值，月之环将能够突破极限功率、获得新的可能性。这一形态的\"U.F.S\"又被称为「理想限制领域」。<br>然而「理想限制领域」在当前仍处于理论假象阶段，具体的启动条件、启动方式乃至启动的可能性皆为未知。</p></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl__fold-tag\">\n      [<span class=\"obc-tmpl__fold-text\">折叠</span><span class=\"obc-tmpl__expand-text\">展开</span>]\n    </div></div></div></div><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\"></p></div></div> <div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__body-endpart\"><hr data-v-f0365338=\"\"> <p data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__copyright\"><img data-v-f0365338=\"\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n        词条内容由圣芙蕾雅档案馆编辑团队原创，禁止转载\n      </p></div> <!---->",
